@page "/"

<PageTitle>Bmage lazy loading sample</PageTitle>

<h1>Lazy loading</h1>

<p>
    This page edits nothing, so the browser has not downloaded <code>Bit.Bmage.wasm</code> or
    <code>Bit.Bmage.Blazor.wasm</code>. Open the <a href="editor">editor</a>: the router downloads them first, then
    renders it.
</p>
